---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cities | Japanerary">
    <div class="my-6 px-10">
        <h1 class="text-4xl text-center font-bold">Cities</h1>
        <div class="lg:flex my-24">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                    <img class="h-3/4 w-3/4" src="/public/tokyo-shinsaibashi.jpg" alt="Photograph of Tokyo, Japan night skyline">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 my-6 lg:my-0">
                <h2 class="text-3xl">Tokyo</h2>
                <div class="w-3/4">
                    <p>We felt like this had to be first. So, let's just get this out of the way and start in the glorious mega city, Japans' capital... Tokyo.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:flex my-24">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                    <img class="h-3/4 w-3/4" src="/public/kyoto-arch2.jpg" alt="Photograph of Kyoto's city and landscape">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 my-6 lg:my-0">
                <h2 class="text-3xl">Kyoto</h2>
                <div class="w-3/4">
                    <p>A true icon of Japan. Popular due to its treasured and well kept history, featuring tantalizing shrines, beautiful landscapes, and welcoming locals. Kyoto stands its ground as one of Japans most important and iconic cities.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
       <div class="lg:flex my-24">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                    <img class="h-3/4 w-3/4" src="/public/nara-todaiji.jpg" alt="Photograph of Deer between grave markers in Nara, Japan">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 my-6 lg:my-0">
                <h2 class="text-3xl">Nara</h2>
                <div class="w-3/4">
                    <p>First, deer. Second, temples. What more could you ask for? Nara is an awesome stop near both Kyoto and Osaka (more on Osaka later) that has become popular for its deer feeding.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:flex my-24">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                    <img class="h-3/4 w-3/4" src="/public/osaka-crab.jpg" alt="Photograph of walkable vendor street with a tower in the background in Osaka, Japan">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 my-6 lg:my-0">
                <h2 class="text-3xl">Osaka</h2>
                <div class="w-3/4">
                    <p>As previously mentioned, Osaka is what many consider another must-go destination when in Japan. Also known as "The Kitchen of Japan" for its delicious cuisine, there are many staple places and foods at this hot spot.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
